rning ritual so clear,"}, {"beat": 172, "text": "Art knows no age; it\u2019s lived, not just a veneer."}, {"beat": 180, "text": "[ solo ]"}, {"beat": 212, "text": "I love accessible art, it makes me feel so much,"}, {"beat": 220, "text": "Museums, exhibits\u2014no, they\u2019re not out of touch!"}, {"beat": 228, "text": "Seeing art in pajamas, my morning ritual so clear,"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "Art knows no age; it\u2019s lived, not just a veneer."}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}